を肯定しながらも、この「すれば」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2040,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"のかたをつける爲に、當然、その後に來","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2064,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"る可き「盜人になるより外に仕方がな","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2088,"width":272,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"い」と云ふ事を、積極的に肯定する丈","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2112,"width":272,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の、勇氣が出ずにゐたのである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2136,"width":240,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2160,"width":300,"height":168},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、大きな嚏をして、それから、大","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2160,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"儀さうに立上つた。夕冷えのする京都","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2184,"width":272,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"は、もう火桶が欲しい程の寒さである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2208,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"風は門の柱と柱との間を、夕闇と共に遠","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2232,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"慮なく、吹きぬける。丹塗の柱にとまつ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2256,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"てゐた蟋蟀も、もうどこかへ行つてしま","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2280,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2304,"width":48,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2328,"width":300,"height":312},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、頸をちゞめながら、山吹の汗衫","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2328,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"に重ねた、紺の襖の肩を高くして門のま","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2352,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"はりを見まはした。雨風の患のない、人","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2376,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"目にかゝる惧のない、一晚樂にねられさ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2400,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"うな所があれば、そこでともかくも、夜","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2424,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"を明かさうと思つたからである。する","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2448,"width":272,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と、幸門の上の樓へ上る、幅の廣い、之","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2472,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"も丹を塗つた梯子が眼についた。上な","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2496,"width":272,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ら、人がゐたにしても、どうせ死人ばか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2520,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"りである。下人は、そこで腰にさげた聖","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2544,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"柄の太刀が鞘走らないやうに氣をつけな","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2568,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"がら、藁草履をはいた足を、その梯子の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2592,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"一番下の段へふみかけた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2616,"width":192,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2640,"width":300,"height":432},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"それから、何分かの後である。羅生門の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2640,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"樓の上へ出る、幅の廣い梯子の中段に、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2664,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"一人の男が、猫のやうに身をちゞめて、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2688,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"息を殺しながら、上の容子を窺つてゐ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2712,"width":272,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。樓の上からさす火の光が、かすか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2736,"width":272,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"に、その男の右の頰をぬらしてゐる。短","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2760,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"い鬚の中に、赤く膿を持つた面皰のある","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2784,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"頰である。下人は、始めから、この上に","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2808,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ゐる者は、死人ばかりだと高を括つてゐ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2832,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。それが、梯子を二三段上つて見る","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2856,"width":272,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と、上では誰か火をとぼして、しかもそ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2880,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の火を其處此處と動かしてゐるらしい。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2904,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"これは、その濁つた、黃いろい光が、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2928,"width":272,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"隅々に蜘蛛の巢をかけた天井裏に、ゆれ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2952,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ながら映つたので、すぐにそれと知れた","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2976,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"のである。この雨の夜に、この羅生門の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3000,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"上で、火をともしてゐるからは、どうせ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3024,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"唯の者ではない。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3048,"width":128,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3072,"width":300,"height":144},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、守宮のやうに足音をぬすんで、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3072,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"やつと急な梯子を、一番上の段まで這ふ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3096,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"やうにして上りつめた。さうして體を出","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3120,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"來る丈、平にしながら、頸を出來る丈、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3144,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"前へ出して、恐る恐る、樓の內を覗いて","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3168,"width":288,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"見た。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3192,"width":48,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3216,"width":300,"height":408},"computed":{"display":